<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou giv’st us, Lord, once more to taste down here</l><l>The joy Thy presence brings, its warmth and cheer;</l><l>With great delight we ’neath Thy shadow rest;</l><l>Thy fruit is sweet to those Thy love has blest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou wast alone, till like the precious grain</l><l>In death Thou layest, but didst rise again;</l><l>And in Thy risen life a countless host</l><l>Are “all of one” with Thee, Thy joy and boast.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
